    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "SCOPE",
      "narration_text": "The first version stays intentionally small. There is one label: Loon. The researcher can draw a box, move or resize it, delete it when necessary, and save. No sprawling taxonomy before the basic loop works.",
